flowchart LR
    Buyer[买家] --> Profile[个人资料 / 钱包]
    Seller[官方卖家] --> Finance[财务看板]
    Profile --> FC[FinanceController]
    Finance --> FC
    Buyer --> OC[OrderController]
    OC --> OS[OrderService]
    FC --> ES[EscrowSettlementService]
    OS --> ES
    ES --> BM[BalanceMapper]
    ES --> TM[TransactionRecordMapper]
    BM --> B[(balance)]
    TM --> T[(transaction_record)]
